{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787354425729116001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"phantasmal-enhanced-barnowl","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"5bfa68d1f9300b376ef6c22927a867db68cabd306f8f791d5fa7be42436eb7a6","event_uuid":"a240c618-7d6a-458d-8913-b6da737dfcea","position":{"commit_sha":"08ff9a5db76eed773b2a1591f53ee89320b50fd2","position":"1787352420262685001-a240c618-7d6a-458d-8913-b6da737dfcea"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"f451b3c4eee57c72991a1980b7b05a9e7ca62da5bd86c72032e04cb71adcfa04","event_uuid":"604d99d7-6d97-445d-a5cf-e2de1317bab6","position":{"commit_sha":"6a71f1637b0b5825166ca346d5815610362de73d","position":"1787352426404112001-604d99d7-6d97-445d-a5cf-e2de1317bab6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"6564c4d847584645c03bee6c7a7b4965e8337c3a17c6fb5f6c0f9721764c88cd","event_uuid":"bccaad12-02d6-4741-bbbd-63479a9036ec","position":{"commit_sha":"bffa055c4df6a5ad0c55a9aaf0c2a9500b9e8caa","position":"1787352433814912001-bccaad12-02d6-4741-bbbd-63479a9036ec"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787352420262685001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"bccaad12-02d6-4741-bbbd-63479a9036ec","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0bd6-4729-e79e-433b"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nFifteen test files hand-build a nested pytest invocation (`[sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pytest\", ..., \"--basetemp\", ...]`); three were missing `--basetemp` and each became its own ticket (`grindable-deviant-angwantibo` in `tests/_store_isolation.py:32-48`, `acidic-ferreous-mole` in `tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py:838-857`, `asbestos-popular-tench` in `tests/unit/test_git_version_floor.py` and siblings). Session log `kilted-centauric-cardinal` root-caused the store-isolation shutdown timeout in the same family.\n\n## Approach\nAdd `tests/_nested_pytest.py` with `run_nested_pytest(tmp_path, *args, timeout, env=None) -> CompletedProcess` that always passes `--basetemp`, `-p no:cacheprovider`, a bounded `timeout`, and `stdin=DEVNULL`; convert the fifteen sites. Guard: a meta-test asserts the literal `\"-m\", \"pytest\"` (and `\"-m pytest\"`) appears under `tests/` only in `_nested_pytest.py` (`# nested-pytest-ok:` escape for a test that must exercise the raw form).\n\n## Scope\n`tests/_nested_pytest.py` (new), `tests/_store_isolation.py`, `tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py`, `tests/unit/test_git_version_floor.py`, the twelve other sites found by `grep -rln '\"-m\", \"pytest\"' tests/`, `tests/unit/test_nested_pytest_helper.py` (new).\n\n## Testing\nHappy path: the helper runs a one-test file and returns rc 0 with its basetemp under `tmp_path`. Edge: a hanging child is killed at `timeout` and reported with rc != 0 (no wall-clock assertion; a hang guard marked `# timing: hang-guard`). Pinning: every converted test file passes unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `grep -rn '\"-m\", \"pytest\"' tests/ | grep -v _nested_pytest.py` is empty; checked by the grep and the meta-test.\n- [ ] Every nested run's basetemp is under the caller's `tmp_path`; checked by the helper test inspecting the child's `--basetemp`.\n- [ ] The fifteen converted files pass in the default `Verified` tier under `-n 4`; checked by CI.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/_nested_pytest.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/_store_isolation.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_git_version_floor.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_nested_pytest_helper.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"],["relates_to","0bd6-4729-e79e-433b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["consolidation","janitor","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"25b4-34a3-09a2-4beb","ticket_type":"story","title":"run_nested_pytest helper that always passes --basetemp, with a meta-test","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a240c618-7d6a-458d-8913-b6da737dfcea","604d99d7-6d97-445d-a5cf-e2de1317bab6","bccaad12-02d6-4741-bbbd-63479a9036ec"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787354425729116001,"uuid":"f7a48046-985e-45cb-a98d-ef1321394645"}